READING: the gas centroid sits ~13 kpc off a perfectly centred gas sphere at t = 0, before any dynamics. The frozen estimator (start at the argmax pixel of a map made by block-repeating 50-kpc gas cells, tol 0.25 kpc) stalls at a block-edge fixed point. Galaxy-centroid shot noise (+-4-9 kpc) adds to it. The lensing centroid stays within 10.6 kpc and M(<300 kpc) drifts -0.13%, so this is a gas-ESTIMATOR offset, not a dynamical drift. It still fails the frozen C4, so the dependent verdicts stay VOID.
